      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T17:18:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Curious but why do these need to be defined within here now? Do all the types now need to be defined in the aidl instead of a separate types.h file?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "3400f65d5ab8fcadd03f1ee10d4f6ebafab3e3fc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9c7544bb_8ec08f0f",
        "filename": "radio/aidl/android/hardware/radio/config/SimPortInfo.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 46,
      "author": {
        "id": 1644679
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T17:28:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no separate types.h file in AIDL.\n*Every type needs its own file.\nIf the values are only used with one type or one interface, it\u0027s typically easier and lighter weight to defined them in that type or interface instead of having a separate enum defined/generated.\n\n\n* there is work going on to be able to nest types: b/182508839",
      "parentUuid": "48de0172_b015d8bb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "3400f65d5ab8fcadd03f1ee10d4f6ebafab3e3fc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
