      "lineNbr": 46,
      "author": {
        "id": 1542950
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T17:40:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When converting from HIDL -\u003e AIDL, we moved a lot of the enums that are specific to a certain class into the actual class instead of keeping them as their own class or creating a constants class. This was for a cleaner/smaller API surface and better readability.",
      "parentUuid": "24e192f2_c014f2f2",
